Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO App Icon

Replace the Cromite icons with the CromIKO mascot (white on the logo
charcoal, with the periwinkle star and ring highlight), generated from
the logo SVG by tools/cromiko/gen_icons.py:
- launcher icon: both ic_launcher and ic_launcher_round are now a
  regular adaptive icon, a solid charcoal background layer plus a
  transparent mascot foreground sized to the 66dp safe zone
- themed (monochrome) icon for Android 13+
- legacy app_icon and fre_product_logo, which are also shown inside the
  app (menu, sign-in screen, message banners): rounded charcoal tile

License: GPL-3.0-only - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-only.html
